   "sentenceId": 13,
   "he": "מְמַלְּאִין מִבּוֹר הַגּוֹלָה. עוּלָּא אִיקְּלַע לְבֵי רַב מְנַשֶּׁה, אֲתָא הָהוּא גַּבְרָא טְרַף אַבָּבָא אֲמַר: מַאן הַאי? לִיתַּחַל גּוּפֵיהּ, דְּקָא מַחֵיל לֵיהּ לְשַׁבְּתָא.",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna: «One» may «draw water from the Cistern of the Exiles» by means of a wheel. The Gemara relates: «Ulla happened» to come «to the house of Rav Menashe» when «a certain man came and knocked at the door.» Ulla «said: Who is that? May his body be desecrated, as he desecrates Shabbat» by producing a sound."
  }
